    stem: "Cadbury has launched its latest products. The stages of the new product development process included Idea Generation, Product Screening and Feasibility Study. Cadbury also engaged in test marketing. Idea Generation, Product Screening and Feasibility Study are the three terms underlined in the paper.",
    questionText: "Explain two of the underlined terms above.",
