    stem: "Pure Clothing, based in Mayo, was founded by Peter Timlin and Richard Grimes in May 2020. The company quickly went viral on TikTok by posting videos which showcased the pair's journey setting up the company and their sustainable model. Pure Clothing is a completely sustainable brand which uses organic cotton and recycled material for its vegan-friendly clothing, which is embroidered in a wind-powered unit in Co. Mayo.",
